From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: po: the Screensavers link of Power Management in the edition's nine other languages

The edition's translations of the strings powerdevil-screensavers-link.patch adds
(queue row 96), on the 6.7.4 catalogues as the edition has patched them so far.
A first draft made with AI assistance, pending native speakers; KDE's
translation teams take the strings later.

Assisted-by: Claude Fable 5.2
---
